":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: v4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nmac os ventura 13.7.7, godot v4.3.stable, Vulkan 1.2.283, Intel - Intel(R) Iris(TM) Plus Graphics 640\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `Image.create_empty()`, the created image always has size `(0,0)`.  \nThis happens even when providing valid width/height values.  \n\nExpected behavior:  \n`Image.create_empty(width, height, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)` should create an image with the given dimensions.  \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project, attach this script to a Node, and run:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\toption1()\n\toption2()\n\toption3()\n\nfunc option1() -> void:\n\tvar img := Image.new()\n\timg.create_empty(500, 500, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n\tprint(\"Image size: \", img.get_size())\n\tprint(\"h: \", img.get_height())\n\tprint(\"w: \", img.get_width())\n\t\nfunc option2() -> void:\n\tvar img := Image.new()\n\timg.create_empty(500, 500, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n\timg.resize(500,500)\n\tprint(\"Image size: \", img.get_size())\n\tprint(\"h: \", img.get_height())\n\tprint(\"w: \", img.get_width())\n\t\nfunc option3() -> void:\n\tvar img := Image.new()\n\timg.create(500, 500, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n\timg.resize(500,500)\n\tprint(\"Image size: \", img.get_size())\n\tprint(\"h: \", img.get_height())\n\tprint(\"w: \", img.get_width())\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22100442/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"ljfantin","id":2002442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDI0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2002442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljfantin","html_url":"https://github.com